### Instructions for Requesting Method Declarations:
In <method>methodName</method>, replace methodName with the actual name of the method for which you need the declaration (e.g., <method>foo</method>). 
Do not include any other information. Do not include parameters or class context; just the method name.  
Use separate <method> tags for each method you are requesting. 
You can only request method declarations; do not request additional code or context.  
Only use <methods> if you are requesting method declarations.  

### Important Notes:
- Be precise and specific in your reasoning
- If the method's return value depends on another method not provided, request its declaration
- If the method can return null in some cases but not this one, explain why this specific invocation is different

